## When Generating Code

1. **Read content files first** if user provides them
2. **Use existing marketing components** before creating new ones
3. **Follow TypeScript types** in shared/types/
4. **Keep route files thin** - composition only
5. **Use Tailwind utilities** - no custom CSS
6. **Maintain responsive design** - mobile-first
7. **Include accessibility** - ARIA attributes, alt text
